          "textExcerpt": "Privacy Policy Vimm's Lair uses cookies to store preferences such as search filters. Registration is optional and requires an e-mail address which is used solely for password recovery. Vimm's Lair will never share your e-mail address with anyone. California Consumer Privacy Act (\u201cCCPA\u201d) Under CCPA, Californian residents have the right to declare their preferences on the sale of data for advertising and marketing purposes. If you wish to change your preferences, click this link to launch our preference portal: We use third parties to provide monetization technologies for our site. You can review their privacy and cookie policy at https://www.publift.com/privacy-policy and https://www.publisher-collective.com/privacy-policy .",
